1. EfficientDet-Lite0 / EfficientDet-Lite2 person detector — Apache-2.0 weights,
   CC BY 3.0 ONNX conversion
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files: efficientdet_lite0.onnx, efficientdet_lite2.onnx, served at /models/*.onnx.

Model and weights: EfficientDet-Lite0 (320x320) and EfficientDet-Lite2 (448x448), from
Google. Copyright 2020 Google LLC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Licence text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  A copy ships at models/LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt.

ONNX conversion: the ONNX export of those weights by Namas Bhandari,
https://github.com/namas191297/efficientdetlite. (c) Namas Bhandari. Licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 licence (CC BY 3.0).
  Licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/legalcode
  A copy ships at models/LICENSE-CC-BY-3.0.txt.

The conversion is a separate work from the Apache-2.0 weights: the .onnx file is not a
Google artefact, and both layers are attributed here. CC BY 3.0 permits commercial use
and redistribution and requires this attribution and licence link; it does not imply
that Namas Bhandari or Google endorses this project. No modifications were made to the
graph; the files are byte-for-byte the upstream ONNX exports and were verified by
SHA-256 (see models/README.md).

No AGPL-licensed model is part of this build. Earlier versions served the AGPL-3.0
YOLO26n weights; that graph is not loaded by this build and is no longer named here.

